  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PCBS  Support to the Palestinian Central Bureau of Statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Palestinian Central Bureau of Statistics PCBS to implement statistical activities , capacity and institutional building plans during the new phase (three years 2021-2023) the Palestinian Authority is expected to to contribute with a minimum of 68 % of the budget including permenant staff salaries .
other donors including Norway will cover the remaining part of the budget , this will be through project support . the Norwegian fund is a core support to the whole budget .</narrative>
  </description>
